title: 'Gnomon bare entry: gnomon in a folder suggests that folder; already-running refuses instead of joining'
summary: Bare gnomon = gnomon up + a fragment-only &cwd=<base64url> folder hint on the TTY launch URL line; GUI prefills clean absolute paths only, shows text, never submits. A running kernel is not joined (REFUSED GNOMON already-running, exit 3) because minting from it needs a gnomon open wire verb that moves clientApiId; design note for T-2026-10-19-001 in spec 2.4 rule 8. Installer scripts/install-darwin.mjs + npm run gnomon:install; README rewritten.
